A filename key's variable is required like a seed's: no --set defining it exits 1 naming it,
once though the seed renders it too, and the destination is not even created.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  e2e_demo:
    tree:
      "{{ slug }}.md": "{{ slug }}\n"
-- cmd --
booping create core.e2e_demo.tree out
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: core.e2e_demo.tree needs --set slug
